research_narrative: |
  Florence Arminda Staggs — known throughout her life to family as "Minnie" — was born 10 March 1866 in Augusta, Woodruff County, Arkansas, the same year and place her brother Robert Staggs was also born, and the same year her father, Eli Staggs, died. Her mother, Nancy Jane Berry, died about five years later, leaving Florence orphaned by early childhood.

  A fuller personal account of Florence's life is published as a journal entry: see [Minnie Staggs](https://www.shannonfield.com/journal/2020/5/17/minnie-staggs).

